@k.words.echidna.noun.1 k.words.sense word=echidna pos=noun n=1 gloss="a burrowing monotreme mammal covered with spines and having a long snout and claws for hunting ants and termites; native to New Guinea" synonym="spiny anteater" synonym=anteater is_a=monotreme kind_of=monotreme kind_of=prototherian kind_of=mammal kind_of=vertebrate kind_of=chordate kind_of=animal kind_of=organism kind_of="living thing" kind_of=whole kind_of=object kind_of="physical entity" kind_of=entity core.source="wordnet 3.1"
